bobzhang/jsonschema
===================

This module is a MoonBit port of python-jsonschema. Unless noted otherwise
in a file's header, it is distributed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

It contains code ported from, and data generated from or embedded verbatim
from, the following third-party works.

python-jsonschema
  Source: https://github.com/python-jsonschema/jsonschema
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) 2013 Julian Berman
  Used for: the validators, keywords, type and format checkers, errors and
  the unit tests ported throughout this module.

jsonschema-specifications
  Source: https://github.com/python-jsonschema/jsonschema-specifications
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) 2022 Julian Berman
  Used for: the meta-schemas and vocabularies embedded in
  specifications/schemas.mbt (the schemas themselves are published by the
  JSON Schema project).

JSON-Schema-Test-Suite
  Source: https://github.com/json-schema-org/JSON-Schema-Test-Suite
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) 2012 Julian Berman
  Used for: the test files and remotes embedded in suite/gen_*_test.mbt.

