  Source: https://github.com/python/cpython
  License: PSF-2.0 (Python Software Foundation License Version 2)
  Copyright (c) 2001 Python Software Foundation; All Rights Reserved
  Used for: the ports of re (internal/regex: the re._parser port, the
  sre-style matcher, the re._casefix case equivalences), json.loads, repr,
  pprint, reprlib, textwrap and float/int semantics (internal/pycompat),
  ipaddress, the punycode codec, datetime.strptime / date.fromisoformat
  checks (internal/formats), and the unicodedata / str predicates the
  tables in internal/unicodedata were generated from.

